        "source:complexity-example-ladder-template"
      ],
      "rationale": "The ladder is explanatory evidence only: it cannot establish admissibility, satisfy an owner gate, alter a recommendation or decision result, constitute consent or approval, authorize mutation, or expand into implementation, promotion, publication, or execution."
